Tinglan has experience in this area.

82
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:29,580
She can participate in supporting work.

83
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:30,760
Mm.

84
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:33,260
Tinglan did well on the last case.

85
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:35,080
Keep up the good work.

86
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,130
Thank you, Lawyer Xiao.

87
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:39,440
Alright.

88
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:41,070
If there's nothing else today,

89
00:04:41,070 --> 00:04:43,070
