149
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:22,680
Anyway, be bold and express yourself.

150
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:23,760
Enjoy it.

151
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,900
Be bold and express yourself.

152
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:27,720
Enjoy it.

